   "texto": [
    "The Dativa often answers the **¿a quién?** (**Wem?**) question.",
    "Key forms: **mir** (to me), **dir** (to you), **ihm** (to it neutral), **ihr** (to it), **uns** (to us), **euch** (to you), **ihnen** (to them) and **Ihnen** (to you).",
    "Verbs with mandatory dative: **Die Ärztin hilft mir** (the doctor helps me); **Ich danke Ihnen** (I thank you); **Der Tee tut ihr gut** (tea feels good for her)."
